{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8d14db40-24e1-8fc7-adb3-c02734bbbc1e",
  "created_at": "2026-02-25T13:12:05-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tariq Kim",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:04:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:04:44-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Yeah. [pause] I'm calling about the street in front of my place. Water from that nor'easter last weekend, the Saturday into Sunday one, it's still sitting there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:05:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. What's the address you're at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:05:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "156 Chapel Street. Up on the Hill, kind of toward the middle of the block."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:05:14-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "156 Chapel, got it. And what's it doing exactly? Is the water coming up out of a drain, or is it pooling?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:05:27-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pooling. So the apron of the driveway, where it meets the street, it dips. It holds a puddle. And the whole thing slopes toward the garage door. [pause] So every time it rains, the water just heads right for the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:05:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Huh. So it's not just sitting, it's draining the wrong way. Toward the garage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:06:00-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Exactly. It's been three days and it's not gone. I mean, it's down some, but there's still a puddle there this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:06:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Is any of it getting into the garage?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:06:20-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not yet. Right up to the edge, though. I'm renting, so I'm not going to go digging around out there myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:06:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, no, that's fair. Writing this down. Driveway apron, ponding, pitches toward the garage door. Anything else out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:06:44-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The sidewalk. It's a sheet of mud and grit. Like the water came across and dumped everything it was carrying. Sand, dirt, little rocks. You can't really walk without slipping."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:07:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. Is that all along the front of your place, or further down too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:07:12-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly in front of ours and a bit past the neighbor's. I didn't walk the whole street. [pause] Honestly I only stepped outside because my wife's asleep. She worked the night shift and I didn't want to be on the phone in the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:07:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, yeah, let her sleep. Do you want to keep your voice down, or are you good out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:07:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm good. I'm on the stoop. It's fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:07:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So, is there a storm drain close by, like at the curb near your driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:08:03-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's one down at the corner, I think. Not right in front of us. I couldn't tell you if it's clogged. It's probably full of the same grit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:08:19-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be. After a storm like that, a lot of the catch basins get silted up. I'll put that in the notes so whoever goes out looks at the drain and the apron both."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:08:39-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That'd be good. Because I don't actually know who's supposed to look at this. Is it you guys? Is it the landlord? I'm asking who I call to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:08:58-05:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the street and the drain and the sidewalk grit, that's us. We'll send somebody to look. The driveway apron itself, depends. If it's the part in the city right-of-way, between the sidewalk and the road, that may be ours. If it's on the property, that'd be your landlord's."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:09:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ugh. Okay. So it might be a bit of both."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:09:33-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be, yeah. The inspector can tell where the line is when they see it. In the meantime, I'd mention it to your landlord too, just so they're aware of the garage door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:09:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I'll text him tonight. He's, um, he's not the fastest to answer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:10:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Let me get a callback number in case the inspector wants to reach you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:10:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0173."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:10:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one seven three. Is that a cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:10:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, cell. It's the best one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:10:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:10:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tariq Kim. T-A-R-I-Q. Kim, like it sounds."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:10:33-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tariq Kim, 156 Chapel. Alright. So what I've got: ponding at the driveway apron, drains toward the garage door, mud and grit across the sidewalk after the weekend storm, possible silted drain at the corner. Did I miss anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:10:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Oh, wait. Is somebody going to come today? Or is it a few days?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:11:06-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Probably not today. Crews are still working through the post-storm list. I'd say within the next few days, maybe into early next week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:11:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. [pause] That's a little long for a garage door, but fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:11:28-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. If it rains again before then and it starts getting into the garage, call back and I'll flag it as more urgent."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:11:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Will do."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:11:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And watch your step on that sidewalk. Mud and grit like that is slick."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:11:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. I noticed. Okay, thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:11:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it, Tariq. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T13:12:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too."
    }
  ],
